e temper management.\n- Evidence that Candidate\u202fC\u2019s communication issues have led to operational problems or cannot be mitigated.\nGiven the current evidence, Candidate\u202fC offers the best overall mix of calm decision\u2011making, technical ability, and crew\u2011focused attitude, despite noted communication concerns.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
