ould hinder crew coordination, but his proven reliability, rapid correct decision\u2011making, and crew\u2011focused attitude outweigh the comparable or greater interpersonal deficits of the other candidates.\n**Remaining uncertainty**\n- How severe are C\u2019s communication problems in real flight operations? Could they lead to misunderstandings that outweigh his decision\u2011making strength?\n- Whether B\u2019s stress handling and technical skills could compensate for his communication issues if he had stronger teamwork evidence.\n- Whether any hidden strengths (e.g., proven teamwork for A or D) exist that could mitigate their interpersonal negatives.\n**What would change my vote**\n- Concrete evidence that Candidate\u202fA or D have strong, demonstrated teamwork/communication and temper\u2011management abilities that offset their current negatives.\n- Evidence that C\u2019s communication difficulties have resulted in operational errors or cannot be mitigated through training.\n- Evidence that Candidate\u202fB possesses strong crew\u2011cooperation skills that outweigh his communication tone issues.\nGiven the current balanced evidence, Candidate\u202fC offers the best overall combination of reliability, calm judgment, and crew\u2011oriented behavior for long\u2011distance flights.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
