ote:** Concrete evidence that A or D possess strong, demonstrated teamwork and communication skills that offset their interpersonal negatives, or evidence that C\u2019s communication issues have led to operational errors that cannot be mitigated.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
