ing uncertainty:** How much C\u2019s communication problems would affect real\u2011world crew coordination and safety on long\u2011haul flights; whether they could lead to misunderstandings that outweigh his decision\u2011making strength.\n**What would change my vote:** Concrete evidence that A or D possess strong, demonstrated teamwork/communication and temper\u2011management abilities that offset their negatives, or evidence that C\u2019s communication issues have caused operational errors that cannot be mitigated.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
